"<div class=\"story\"><h2>Como jogar</h2>\n      <ul class=\"help\">\n        <li><b>W A S D</b> andar · <b>Shift</b> correr (gasta fôlego) · <b>Espaço</b> pular · <b>V</b> câmera</li>\n        <li><b>Segurar o botão esquerdo</b> numa pedra: minerar · <b>clicar várias vezes</b>: golpes mais rápidos (gasta fôlego)</li>\n        <li><b>E</b> perto de um NPC: abrir a loja · <b>J</b> missões · <b>Tab</b> mochila</li>\n        <li><b>1 2 3</b> power-ups · <b>R</b> transporte · <b>L</b> luz · <b>G</b> seta do detector (segure para escolher)</li>\n        <li><b>H</b> voltar à cidade voando (martelo 20+) · <b>N</b> o que fazer ao chegar na vila · <b>U</b> vender o depósito</li>\n        <li><b>Q Z X</b> gancho, escada, cama elástica · <b>Espaço no ar</b> jetpack (itens de escalada do Tonho)</li>\n        <li><b>M</b> som · <b>Esc</b> soltar o mouse e abrir o menu</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>Saia da cidade, encha a mochila e volte. Seu Lauro compra o que sobra. Gaste no Ferreiro (martelo), na Tropeira (melhorias) e na Botica (power-ups).</p>\n      <p>A informação embaixo da mira mostra o tempo de cada pedra: <b style=\"color:#7fd36a\">verde</b> vale a pena, <b style=\"color:#ffd34d\">amarelo</b> é lento, <b style=\"color:#ff6a5a\">vermelho</b> não compensa.</p>\n      {0}\n      <h4>Progresso</h4><p class=\"hint\" style=\"margin-top:0\">Salva sozinho. {1}</p>\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\"><button class=\"buy alt\" onclick=\"Backup.manual()\">💾 Salvar agora</button><button class=\"buy alt\" onclick=\"UI.exportSave()\">Exportar</button><button class=\"buy alt\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('impfile').click()\">Importar</button><button class=\"buy alt\" onclick=\"Backup.restoreFromFile()\">📂 Da pasta</button><input type=\"file\" id=\"impfile\" accept=\".json\" style=\"display:none\" onchange=\"UI.importSave(this.files[0])\"></div>\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><button class=\"buy\" onclick=\"UI.close()\">Voltar ao jogo</button><button class=\"buy alt\" onclick=\"if(confirm('Apagar todo o progresso e recomeçar?'))Game.reset()\">Recomeçar do zero</button></div><p class=\"hint\" style=\"text-align:center\">Vale Ferrado v{2}</p></div>": "<div class=\"story\"><h2>How to play</h2> <ul class=\"help\"> <li><b>W A S D</b> move · <b>Shift</b> run (uses stamina) · <b>Space</b> jump · <b>V</b> camera</li> <li><b>Hold the left button</b> on a rock: mine · <b>click repeatedly</b>: faster hits (uses stamina)</li> <li><b>E</b> near an NPC: open the shop · <b>J</b> missions · <b>Tab</b> bag</li> <li><b>1 2 3</b> power-ups · <b>R</b> transport · <b>L</b> light · <b>G</b> detector arrow (hold to choose)</li> <li><b>H</b> fly back to town (hammer 20+) · <b>N</b> what to do when arriving in town · <b>U</b> sell storage</li> <li><b>Q Z X</b> hook, ladder, trampoline · <b>Space in the air</b> jetpack (climbing items from Tonho)</li> <li><b>M</b> sound · <b>Esc</b> release the mouse and open the menu</li> </ul> <p>Leave town, fill your bag and come back. Lauro buys what's left over. Spend it at the Blacksmith (hammer), Cida (upgrades) and the Apothecary (power-ups).</p> <p>The info under the crosshair shows how long each rock takes: <b style=\"color:#7fd36a\">green</b> is worth it, <b style=\"color:#ffd34d\">yellow</b> is slow, <b style=\"color:#ff6a5a\">red</b> isn't worth it.</p> {0} <h4>Progress</h4><p class=\"hint\" style=\"margin-top:0\">Saves automatically. {1}</p> <div class=\"row\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\"><button class=\"buy alt\" onclick=\"Backup.manual()\">💾 Save now</button><button class=\"buy alt\" onclick=\"UI.exportSave()\">Export</button><button class=\"buy alt\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('impfile').click()\">Import</button><button class=\"buy alt\" onclick=\"Backup.restoreFromFile()\">📂 From folder</button><input type=\"file\" id=\"impfile\" accept=\".json\" style=\"display:none\" onchange=\"UI.importSave(this.files[0])\"></div> <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><button class=\"buy\" onclick=\"UI.close()\">Back to game</button><button class=\"buy alt\" onclick=\"if(confirm('Erase all progress and start over?'))Game.reset()\">Start over from scratch</button></div><p class=\"hint\" style=\"text-align:center\">Vale Ferrado v{2}</p></div>",
